flowchart LR
    CLI[Codex CLI experiment loop] --> TRACE[AgentBench trace mode<br/>codex_swebenchpro]
    TRACE --> REPLAY[AgentInfer exact replay<br/>task/request/calibration gate]
    REPLAY --> API[vLLM OpenAI server<br/>TP1 · MTP · FP8 KV]

    subgraph SERVE[vLLM serving layers]
        API --> L0[Engine / API<br/>tokenizer · metrics]
        L0 --> L1[Scheduler<br/>async · chunked prefill]
        L1 --> OUT[Output processing<br/>append · EOS · stop · length<br/>fast path opt-in]
        OUT --> L2[Model runner<br/>CUDA graphs · input prep]
        L2 --> L3[Hybrid Qwen3.8<br/>full attention + GDN]
        L3 --> L4[Operator dispatch<br/>NVFP4 GEMM · GDN · attention]
        L4 --> GPU[1 × B300 SM103]
    end

    GPU --> EXEC[torch profiler GPU execute spans]
    L0 --> HOST[torch profiler host spans]
    L1 --> HOST
    OUT --> HOST
    L2 --> HOST
    HOST --> BUBBLE[CPU bubble ledger<br/>prepare_inputs · schedule<br/>metadata · UVA copies]
    EXEC --> HOTSPOT[operator ledger<br/>FP4 GEMM · qkvz · GDN<br/>conversion · postconv]
    BUBBLE --> ORACLE[profile-driven hypothesis gate]
    HOTSPOT --> ORACLE
    ORACLE --> MICRO[shape correctness + microbench]
    MICRO --> REPLAY
    REPLAY --> QUALITY[GSM8K quality gate<br/>parsed · correct · errors]
    QUALITY --> KB[knowledge base<br/>dashboard · architecture<br/>next layer hypothesis]
    KB --> CLI

    classDef control fill:#e8f1e8,stroke:#5d9b6f,color:#253238;
    classDef serve fill:#eaf1ff,stroke:#6b8fd6,color:#253238;
    classDef evidence fill:#fff4df,stroke:#c58b2c,color:#253238;
    classDef gate fill:#fbe8e8,stroke:#c46a6a,color:#253238;
    class CLI,TRACE,REPLAY,KB control;
    class API,L0,L1,OUT,L2,L3,L4,GPU serve;
    class EXEC,HOST,BUBBLE,HOTSPOT,MICRO,QUALITY evidence;
    class ORACLE gate;
